            Paragraph(Text("The source quantifies finite V,E,L, DecidableEq V,L, graph G and arbitrary label function p : E → L. The history homeomorphisms additionally require discrete topological E and L. numbered_forget is the opposite positive recoding (S,R), with no time shift. numbered_lift is the (R,S) positive recoding followed by literal negative unit translation. It does not use another parallel-edge ranking or assume nonempty endpoint fibers.")),
            Paragraph(Text("These constructions and identities are repository-derived. Their provenance does not assert literature novelty.")),
